SHEPHERD-Advanced — licence status
==================================

Copyright (c) 2026 the SHEPHERD-Advanced authors. All rights reserved.

No open-source licence is granted at this time.

This repository is public for transparency and review, not for redistribution.
No permission is given to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute,
sublicense, or sell copies of this software or substantial portions of it.

Why there is no licence yet
---------------------------
The project is built for one deploying institution and is currently tailored to
that deployment. Rather than attach an open-source licence to software that no
third party has asked to use, the decision has been deferred until there is a
concrete request. This is a deliberate position, not an oversight — the file is
not empty and the packaging metadata declares no licence.

If you want to use or collaborate on this project
--------------------------------------------------
Open an issue, or contact the maintainers. A licence will be chosen when there
is a real request to answer, and the choice will be made together with the
deploying institution.

No warranty
-----------
This software is research and engineering work. It is not a certified medical
device and is not for autonomous clinical decision-making. It is provided
without warranty of any kind.
